      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If: (a) a designated telecommunications network was in existence immediately before the designated commencement date; and (b) a line came into existence on or after the designated commencement date for the purposes of connecting particular premises to the network; and (c) the coming into existence of the line enables or enabled the occupier of the premises to become a customer in relation to carriage services supplied using the line; and (d) the premises are in close proximity to a line that forms part of the infrastructure of the network as the network stood immediately before the designated commencement date; and (e) the line mentioned in paragraph (b) is used to supply a superfast carriage service;"
    },
