      },
      "cml:operator": "TemporalRelevance",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The ACCC must not vary a standard functional separation undertaking under subsection (1) unless the variation: addresses the matter or matters that constituted the grounds for the revocation of the undertaking under section 151W; and does not address any other matter."
    },
