        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Primary network's principal function is during the carriage service period.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the principal function of the primary network is to supply carriage services between customer equipment connected to the primary network and other such equipment;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The carriage service is exempt if the primary network supplies services between customer equipment and other such equipment.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exempts carriage services under certain conditions.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "exemption",
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the service is supplied by means of a telecommunications network (a primary network) that is connected to one or more line links or other facilities..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The primary network may supply services between customer equipment and other such equipment as an ancillary function for exemption purposes.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permits primary network to supply services between customer equipment and other such equipment for exemption purposes.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "permission",
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the supply of carriage services between such equipment and equipment connected to the network units is, at most, an ancillary function of the primary network;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The primary network must supply services between customer equipment and other such equipment for the carriage service to be exempt.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines a subclass of 'carriage service' for exemption purposes.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "subclassOf",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) For the purposes of this section, a carriage service is an exempt service if..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The primary network must be connected to one or more line links or other facilities for it to be exempt.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines a subclass of 'primary network' for exemption purposes.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "subclassOf",
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the service is supplied by means of a telecommunications network (a primary network) that is connected to one or more line links or other facilities..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The primary network must not be used in carrying a communication until the carriage service period ends.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Primary network cannot be used in carrying a communication between equipment connected to network units and other such equipment until the carriage service period ends.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "until",
      "cml:premiseText": "(d) despite the connection or connections referred to in paragraph (a), the primary network cannot be used in carrying a communication, as a single transaction, between equipment connected to the network units and other such equipment;"
    },
